{"3636240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death By Pixel", "steam_appid": 3636240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful gear, unlock your true potential, and overcome deadly enemies. Customize your arsenal and master a unique elemental fusion system, or unleash powerful abilities at the cost of your shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Biomes with multiple levels, packed with combat, exploration and puzzle challenges, each biome is protected by a powerful boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies with different tactics, skills and resistances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ Unique weapon types, suited for different play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Skill Trees with Active and Passive Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Body Armor customization, 7 attachment types with several rarities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple utility items for combat and exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/51411cfbe0425de62efe7baee9aa7275.poster.avif?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/51411cfbe0425de62efe7baee9aa7275.webm?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/51411cfbe0425de62efe7baee9aa7275.mp4?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      Stay Safe behind shield, or take the risk</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/4b5a82af100f47c928736cd8df35bc86.webp?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your energy shield is more than just a resource. Keep it to protect against enemy attacks, or redirect it into powerful skills. If you are running low, perfect your timing and take energy from enemy projectiles. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/12944fa7d948223147dcc4c4d1ce11bf.poster.avif?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/12944fa7d948223147dcc4c4d1ce11bf.webm?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/12944fa7d948223147dcc4c4d1ce11bf.mp4?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><strong>      Explore, Fight and Get Stronger</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/e4c4e5be375d52060ddf7b9babb3071c.webp?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for any encounter with 4 skill trees supporting different playstyles. Customize your weapons, armor and items to overcome challenges and become a legendary warrior. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/9da0963eed63783e56e9d6f98c48a08f.poster.avif?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/9da0963eed63783e56e9d6f98c48a08f.webm?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/9da0963eed63783e56e9d6f98c48a08f.mp4?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      Change the tide of War  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/48a85cc46f216d75f15a8b4c77e97d5a.webp?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Creator has abandoned this land. The world is torn between a spreading plague and a self-proclaimed ruler imposing his will on all beings. You wake up as a prisoner in a research complex, rescued just before the outbreak of revolution. Are you able to overcome the rampant evil?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/62e9b4fe0b1834350ea883faa6f87548.poster.avif?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/62e9b4fe0b1834350ea883faa6f87548.webm?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/62e9b4fe0b1834350ea883faa6f87548.mp4?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful gear, unlock your true potential, and overcome deadly enemies. Customize your arsenal and master a unique elemental fusion system, or unleash powerful abilities at the cost of your shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Biomes with multiple levels, packed with combat, exploration and puzzle challenges, each biome is protected by a powerful boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies with different tactics, skills and resistances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ Unique weapon types, suited for different play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Skill Trees with Active and Passive Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Body Armor customization, 7 attachment types with several rarities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple utility items for combat and exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/51411cfbe0425de62efe7baee9aa7275.poster.avif?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/51411cfbe0425de62efe7baee9aa7275.webm?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/51411cfbe0425de62efe7baee9aa7275.mp4?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>      Stay Safe behind shield, or take the risk</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/4b5a82af100f47c928736cd8df35bc86.webp?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your energy shield is more than just a resource. Keep it to protect against enemy attacks, or redirect it into powerful skills. If you are running low, perfect your timing and take energy from enemy projectiles. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/12944fa7d9482