. The world is torn between a spreading plague and a self-proclaimed ruler imposing his will on all beings. You wake up as a prisoner in a research complex, rescued just before the outbreak of revolution. Are you able to overcome the rampant evil?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/62e9b4fe0b1834350ea883faa6f87548.poster.avif?t=1786958804\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/62e9b4fe0b1834350ea883faa6f87548.webm?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/extras/62e9b4fe0b1834350ea883faa6f87548.mp4?t=1786958804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Death By Pixel is an action RPG shooter with exploration elements. Experiment with elemental weapon combinations, exploit enemy weaknesses and trade your defenses for devastating abilities.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/7e6f22d862520b9c97d1ffb8fa7609e411ae5c8c/header.jpg?t=1786958804", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/02907dbbd633862f23b1f79c30d1d8ca6b5235f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786958804", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636240/02907dbbd633862f23b1f79c30d1d8ca6b5235f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786958804", "website": "https://impress.games/press-kit/prismatica-studio/death-by-pixel?access=ta26prHLJvkyVztinQxOLNqx", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<b